<div class="container page-body">
  <article class="article prose">
      <p>Open slots for July–December 2027 are now accepting applications. Apply at least 45 days before your get-in. When applications overlap, the earliest received takes priority.</p>
      <h2>Available slots</h2>
      <p>21–26 Sep, 28 Sep–1 Oct, 5–10 Oct, 19–24 Oct, 26–31 Oct, 2–7 Nov, 16–21 Nov<br>The Youxin Theatre availability calendar is the final reference.</p>
      <h2>How to apply</h2>
      <p>Combine the documents below into one PDF and email it with the subject “Youxin Theatre open slot – dates – applicant – event title”.</p>
      <div class="doc-box">
        <h2>Documents</h2>
        <ul class="file-list"><li class="file-item"><span class="name">[1-1B] Youxin Theatre slot application (open slots)</span><ul class="formats"><li><a class="btn btn--file" href="#">Download ODT<span class="visually-hidden">: [1-1B] Youxin Theatre slot application (open slots)</span></a></li><li><a class="btn btn--file" href="#">Download PDF<span class="visually-hidden">: [1-1B] Youxin Theatre slot application (open slots)</span></a></li></ul></li><li class="file-item"><span class="name">[1-2] Youxin Theatre venue and equipment hire form</span><ul class="formats"><li><a class="btn btn--file" href="#">Download ODT<span class="visually-hidden">: [1-2] Youxin Theatre venue and equipment hire form</span></a></li><li><a class="btn btn--file" href="#">Download PDF<span class="visually-hidden">: [1-2] Youxin Theatre venue and equipment hire form</span></a></li></ul></li></ul>
      </div>
      <p class="note">Enquiries: (02) 3366-5060 ext. 10, Mr. Chung</p>
